                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Integers noting the thermal status of a subject according to
the assigned comfort_parameter.
_
Values are one of the following:
* -2 = too dry (but thermally neutral)
* -1 = cold
*  0 = netural
* +1 = hot
* +2 = too humid (but thermally neutral)</item>
