                        <chunk name="OutputParam" index="6">
                          <items count="6">
                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A list of 6 terms for heat loss from the human energy
balance calculation that underlies PMV. Valeus are in W.
_
The terms are ordered as follows:
- Conduction
- Sweating
- Latent Respiration
- Dry Respiration
- Radiation
- Convection</item>
